{"title": "Sampson", "pageid": 48269, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Sampson", "categories": ["Characters in the Blighted Village", "Mentioned characters", "Blacksmiths"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Sampson</b> was a blacksmith in the <a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Village\" title=\"Blighted Village\">Blighted Village</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>He had been diagnosed with gout by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ilyn_Toth\" title=\"Ilyn Toth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png/25px-Portrait_Custom.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png/38px-Portrait_Custom.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png/50px-Portrait_Custom.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ilyn Toth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png/25px-Portrait_Custom.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ilyn_Toth\" title=\"Ilyn Toth\">Ilyn Toth</a><sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>. He worked at the <a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Village#Blacksmith's_Forge\" title=\"Blighted Village\">Blacksmith's Forge</a> and had two known apprentices: Highcliff<sup id=\"cite_ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> with who he had disagreements on the practice, and Dida, who was treated by Ilyn for minor burns to the face and hands from her eagerness at the forge.<sup id=\"cite_ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Sampson kept his belongings in his wooden chest which was locked with a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heavy_Key_(Blighted_Village)\" title=\"Heavy Key (Blighted Village)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Key_Silver_A_Icon.png/20px-Key_Silver_A_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Key_Silver_A_Icon.png/30px-Key_Silver_A_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Key_Silver_A_Icon.png/40px-Key_Silver_A_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Key_Silver_A_Icon.png/20px-Key_Silver_A_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4d/Key_Silver_A_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heavy_Key_(Blighted_Village)\" title=\"Heavy Key (Blighted Village)\">heavy key</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<div class=\"notebegin\">\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act3::before{content:\"Act 3\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-style:italic;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-url::before{content:\"External links\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-text::before{content:\"Literature\";text-decorati